WEBVTT

00:06:29.552 --> 00:06:31.262
trying to figure out why

00:06:31.262 --> 00:06:35.057
and trying to answer that age-old question
of “Is that all there is?”

00:06:35.474 --> 00:06:37.977
Personally, I don’t have time for that,

00:06:37.977 --> 00:06:41.647
because the only time I want to be
kept up all night long tossing and turning

00:06:41.647 --> 00:06:44.108
is when I’m in the company
of a fine-ass man.

00:06:44.233 --> 00:06:45.234
(Laughter)

00:06:45.317 --> 00:06:46.318
(Applause and cheers)

00:06:47.194 --> 00:06:48.195
That's it.

00:06:48.237 --> 00:06:49.238
(Applause)

00:06:50.614 --> 00:06:52.074
I wish I could tell you guys

00:06:52.074 --> 00:06:54.535
that I learned all these valuable
lessons from Lolly

00:06:54.535 --> 00:06:56.996
and they were instilled in me
and it was great,

00:06:56.996 --> 00:06:59.748
but alas, I am a late bloomer
in all regards.